{"item_id": "core-b3-numeric-d5cf432a2e", "model": "gemini/gemini-3.6-flash", "status": "ok", "parsed": {"answer": 136926, "unit": "W/m^2", "stage_answers": {"S1": {"value": "Nucleate pool boiling, Rohsenow correlation", "unit": ""}, "S2": {"value": "399.3 m^-1", "unit": ""}, "S3": {"value": "0.8166", "unit": ""}, "S4": {"value": "136926 W/m^2", "unit": ""}}, "option_verdicts": [], "ambiguous": false, "ambiguity_reason": "", "working": "1. Buoyancy term: [g(rho_l - rho_v)/sigma]^0.5 = [9.81 * (957.9 - 0.5955) / 58.9e-3]^0.5 = 399.30 m^-1.\n2. Dimensionless ratio: [c_p,l * DeltaT_e / (C_sf * h_fg * Pr_l^n)] = [4217 * 10 / (0.0130 * 2257e3 * 1.76)] = 0.81661.\n3. Pre-factor: mu_l * h_fg = 279e-6 * 2257e3 = 629.703 W/m.\n4. Heat flux: q'' = 629.703 * 399.30 * (0.81661)^3 = 136926 W/m^2."}, "label_map": {}}
{"item_id": "core-b3-numeric-277c10be4d", "model": "gemini/gemini-3.5-flash", "status": "ok", "parsed": {"answer": 63523.4, "unit": "W", "stage_answers": {"S1": {"value": "Nusselt laminar film condensation model; DeltaT = 20 K", "unit": ""}, "S2": {"value": 2314201.6, "unit": ""}, "S3": {"value": 6352.34, "unit": ""}, "S4": {"value": 63523.4, "unit": ""}}, "option_verdicts": [], "ambiguous": false, "ambiguity_reason": "", "working": "DeltaT = 100 - 80 = 20 K.\nh'_fg = 2257000 + 0.68 * 4206 * 20 = 2314201.6 J/kg.\nh = 0.943 * [9.81 * (965)^2 * (0.675)^3 * 2314201.6 / (315e-6 * 20 * 0.5)]^(1/4) = 6352.34 W/(m^2.K).\nArea A = 0.5 * 1.0 = 0.5 m^2.\nQ = h * A * DeltaT = 6352.34 * 0.5 * 20 = 63523.4 W."}, "label_map": {}}
